//@ reason: unaffected by the new class-typed dispatch branches in
//@ reason: EscapeHatchChecker/AstEmitter -- both container and class-typed
//@ reason: subscripting coexist in the same program without cross-
//@ reason: contamination (the class-typed branch only fires when
